  <p id="c-chenshu-021-wanggu-daughter-marriage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">天嘉二年，至都，拜國子祭酒。三年，遷中書令。四年，又為散騎常侍、國子祭酒。其年，以<persName id="c-chenshu-021-wanggu-daughter-marriage:p001:m0041" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE">固</persName>女為皇太子妃，禮遇甚重。</p>
</text>
